{"meta":{"id":"installation","category":"it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu","title":"설치","subtitle":"(Ubuntu)","summary":"우분투 설치 방식과 준비물","tags":["리눅스","우분투","ubuntu","설치"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-install","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>\n      우분투 1\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Linux Basics</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    설치 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-amber-600 font-serif\">(Ubuntu)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 우분투 데스크톱/서버 설치 방식과 준비물\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">공식 사이트(ubuntu.com)에서 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">LTS(장기지원) 버전</strong> ISO를 받는 것이 안정적</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Rufus/balenaEtcher로 부팅 USB를 만든 뒤 \"Try or Install Ubuntu\"로 진행</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">설치 중 \"서드파티 소프트웨어 설치\"를 체크하면 미디어 코덱/드라이버가 자동 설치됨</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">설치 방식 비교</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">4가지 방식</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[30%]\">구분 및 방식</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[13%]\">난이도</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[37%]\">특징</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[20%]\">파일</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[권장]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">일반 설치</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">하</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">GUI, 오피스/미디어 앱까지 함께 설치</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center\">\n            <button data-download-path=\"it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu/installation\" data-download-name=\"우분투 일반 설치 가이드.zip\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/70 hover:bg-amber-200/70 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n              <svg class=\"w-3 h-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4\"></path></svg>\n              다운로드\n            </button>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[경량]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">최소 설치</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">하</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">기본 앱만 설치되어 가벼움</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-300 text-xs\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[듀얼부팅]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Windows 병행</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">중</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">설치 마법사가 파티션 자동 분할 지원</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-300 text-xs\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[서버]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">Ubuntu Server</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">중</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">GUI 없이 커맨드라인 전용, 클라우드/서버용</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center text-stone-300 text-xs\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">설치 후 체크리스트</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">설치 후 가장 먼저 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade</code>로 최신 패키지를 반영합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">그래픽 드라이버는 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">\"소프트웨어 & 업데이트 &gt; 추가 드라이버\"</strong>에서 확인/설치할 수 있습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">GNOME 소프트웨어(스토어) 대신 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">apt</code>로 설치하면 더 빠르고 가볍습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>Linux Basics Guide</span>\n  <span>Ubuntu</span>\n</div>\n","path":"it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu/installation","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"linux","title":"리눅스","path":"it/linux"},{"id":"linux-types","title":"리눅스 종류","path":"it/linux/linux-types"},{"id":"ubuntu","title":"우분투 (Ubuntu)","path":"it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu"}],"hasImage":false}